was extre (...)\\n\\n11While showing foreign content, TRT was also interested in producing Turkish television films ... \",\"title\":\"https://journals.openedition.org/tvseries/2406\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d83\"},\"ref\":\"d83\",\"snippet\":\" ... Later life\\n\\nBy the late 1970s, Waheed was being cast in supporting roles either with Nadeem or with Mohammad Ali. Most of the leading heroines like Zeba, Shabnam and Nisho were not allowed to play lead roles with Waheed by their husbands. Pervaiz Malik wrote in a local ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Waheed_Murad\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d84\"},\"ref\":\"d84\",\"snippet\":\" ... Gülcan Aslan (born May 1, 1986, Istanbul, Turkey) - Turkish actress, acted in commercials and TV shows. Her first starring role in the series \\\"In spite of all\\\" (Herşeye Rağmen). Also appeared: \\\"Sardunya Sokak\\\" (Street geranium), \\\"Gurbet Kuşları\\\" (Bird-in-exile), \\\"Kahramanlar\\\" (Heroes).\\n\\n8. Seda Guven (born June 11 ... \",\"title\":\"https://beauty-around.com/en/tops/item/60-samyue-krasivyie-turkey-actress\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d85\"},\"ref\":\"d85\",\"snippet\":\" ... The husband was a gold-medalist of the world championships. His wife left a career of a two-time Olympic champion to raise their baby. We hope they are going to raise a new volleyball star;\\n\\n- Bahar Toksoy and Giovanni Guidetti – a Turkish couple of a volleyball player ... \",\"title\":\"https://volleycountry.com/news/world-famous-volleyball-couples\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_rang