se,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d87\"},\"ref\":\"d87\",\"snippet\":\" ... Karayilan has appeared in the TV series Cümbür Cemaat Aile, Muhtesem Yüzyil, Benim Adim Gültepe, Serçe Sarayi, Hatirla Gönül, Payitaht Abdülhamit, Azize, and in the movies \\\"Cicero\\\", \\\"Naim\\\" and \\\"Mücadele Cikmazi\\\".\\n\\nSelen Öztürk, who received the \\\"Best Female Voice Over Artist of the Year\\\" award by Evos Angels ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/list/ls086937225/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d53\"},\"ref\":\"d53\",\"snippet\":\" ... Her television debut in 2013, in the historical series Muhtesem Yüzyil and played the character of Huricihan Sultan. Her breakthrough came with her role as Nazli Yilmaz in youth series Günesin Kizlari. She made her cinematic debut with the historical movie Direnis Karatay who won Türkiye Gençlik Best ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/list/ls020748690/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d88\"},\"ref\":\"d88\",\"snippet\":\" ... Even \\\"Muhtesem Yüzyıl\\\" (Magnificent Century), perhaps Turkey's biggest TV series export and most well-known TV series to date, was also beaten by \\\"Sıla\\\" in Greece. The series lost more than 15 percent of ratings to \\\"Sıla,\\\" which airs in the same time slot.\\n\\nDuring its three ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.dailysabah.com/arts-culture/2014/03/03/macedonian-channels-fight-over-rights-to-turkish-series\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d69\"},\"ref\":\"d69\",\"snippet\":\" ... In terms of proportions, the most popular and classic narration is that Osman is the grandson of Süleyman Şah, who died drowning while crossing