s of consanguinity. These laws would severely cri\",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cousin_marriage\"},{\"navigation_seen\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d122\"},\"ref\":\"d122\",\"snippet\":\" ... The sophisticated historical drama, set in 17th-century feudal Japan, follows three primary characters: Toranaga (played by Hiroyuki Sanada), a lord whose \",\"title\":\"https://www.theatlantic.com/culture/archive/2024/12/best-tv-shows-2024-hacks-shogun-industry/680850/\"},{\"navigation_seen\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d121\"},\"ref\":\"d121\",\"snippet\":\" ... 2\\n\\n- Height: 160 cm\\n\\n- Career: Actress, commercial model, and entrepreneur\\n\\nMarian Riviera is one of the most renowned Filipino actresses. She is best know\",\"title\":\"https://kami.com.ph/110977-most-beautiful-filipino-actresses-and-stars.html\"},{\"navigation_seen\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d120\"},\"ref\":\"d120\",\"snippet\":\" ... 700px) {\\n  #_cm-css-reset._cm-single-inline #_cm-close-area {\\n    top: 0 !important;\\n  }\\n}\\n#_cm-css-reset._cm-single-inline ._cm-content-video {\\n  position\",\"title\":\"https://thenationonlineng.net/how-i-got-a-big-scar-on-my-hand-nollywood-diva-uche-jombo/\"},{\"navigation_seen\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d119\"},\"ref\":\"d119\",\"snippet\":\" ... Eva Longoria\\n\\nEva Longoria's height: 5′ 1″ or 155 cm\\n\\nEva Longoria, born March 15, 1975, is best known for her role in Desperate Housewives. In 2023 Longor\",\"title\":\"https://www.yahoo.com/entertainment/68-short-celebrity-women-5-164600061.html\"},{\"navigation_seen\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d118\"},\"ref\":\"d118\",\"snippet\":\" ... 5′ 1″ or 155 cm\\n\\nEva Longoria, born March 15, 1975, is best known for her role in Desperate Housewives. In 2023 Longoria made her feature directorial debut\",\"title\":\"https://www.sheknows